          <p class="mt-1 hidden text-xs leading-snug text-navy-500 sm:block">Manage schools, programs, and sessions; run promotions; generate certificates.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>

  <footer class="mx-auto mt-2 flex w-full max-w-6xl shrink-0 items-center justify-center gap-2 border-t border-navy-100 py-2 text-[10px] text-navy-400 sm:mt-3 sm:text-[11px]">
    <img src="/images/gu-logo.webp" alt="Geeta University" class="h-4 w-auto rounded bg-white p-0.5 sm:h-5" />
    <span>&copy; <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> Geeta University. AI-Watch Assessment Portal.</span>
  </footer>
</div>
